  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the protection of civilians from weapons - Art.36</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy development and advocacy regarding protection of civilians and civilian infrastructure from harm from weapons. Collaborative action between civil society through global coalitions and by collaborating with key partners including representatives from states and international organisations, to promote international norms and standards and practical action towards the fulfilment of International Humanitarian Law.</narrative>
  </description>
